s://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173692751/events/428890594/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173692751/events/428890594.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173692746\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[COYOTE Vs ACME]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Coyote Vs Acme&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/30h174x2g577sbot8bo8h8z2tj0v/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Animation/Comedy/Adventure</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">USA | 2026 | 101 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director: Dave Green</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Will Forte, Lana Condor, John Cena</font></div><div><b style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\">This film contains flashing images which may affect viewers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy.<font size=\"3\"></font></b></div><div><p><font size=\"3\">When loyal Acme\nCorporation customer (and avowed enemy of Road Runner) Wile E. Coyote has\nfinally had enough of the company&rsquo;s faulty goods, he&rsquo;s left with one last\ncourse of action: a lawsuit. Securing the services of ambulance-chasing\nattorney Kevin Avery (Will Forte), the pair have to take on Acme&rsquo;s hotshot\nlawyer Buddy Crane (John Cena), who happens to be Avery&rsquo;s former boss. Three\nyears after being shelved as a tax write-off by its studio, this madcap mix of\nanimation and live-action is seeing the light of day at long last, presenting\nthe world of Looney Tunes as you&rsquo;ve never seen it before.</font></p></div><div><br></div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>Animated Film</event_category>\