8/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693765/events/428897758.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428897759\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[05 Nov 2026 - 19:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 18:45) DIGGER]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-05T19:30:00+00:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-05T18:45:00+00:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428897759</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693765/events/428897759/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693765/events/428897759.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173692836\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[DRACULA]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font><b style=\"font-size:x-large;\">Dracula </b><font size=\"3\">(Cert TBC)</font><b style=\"font-size:x-large;\">&nbsp;</b></font><font size=\"5\"><b>&amp; Short film</b></font>\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre: Horror</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK | 1958 | 83 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Terence Fisher\n</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Peter Cushing, Christopher Lee, Michael Gough\n</font></div><div>\n<p><font size=\"3\">A landmark in English Gothic horror, <b><i>Dracula</i></b> made\nChristopher Lee an international star, and caused major American distributors\nto compete to release Hammer&rsquo;s films. Elegant but shocking, this first colour\nadaptation of Bram Stoker&rsquo;s novel offered Lee&rsquo;s physicality and seductive\nmenace, opposite Peter Cushing&rsquo;s fearless Van Helsing. Now, following the\ndiscovery of film elements in a Warner Bros. warehouse, a brand new restoration\nbrings the original uncut version (previously only seen in Japan in 1958) to UK\ncinemas for the first time! Halloween screening, with support from Croydon\nCouncil.</font></p>\n<p><b><font size=\"3\">Plus\na short (10 mins) exploring the film&rsquo;s restoration.</font></b></p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p>\n<p><font size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><i>SPECIAL OFFER:</i>Save &pound;2 by booking both Halloween Dracula films\nat the same time. Ensure that both have been added to your basket before\nchecking out.</font></p>\n</div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category></event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://www.davidleancinema.uk/#whatson</url>\n        <version>66</version>\n        <tags>\n          <tag>hw</tag>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vqhkc77vvee2ih5qzeov9nm3ic88/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vqhkc77vvee2ih5qzeov9nm3ic88/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/vqhkc77vvee2ih5qzeov9nm3ic88/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n          <image priority=\"0\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2kfj3pca7q3pq37fg9chdkz00vpv/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd</url>\n            <url size=\"medium\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2kfj3pca7q3pq37fg9chdkz00vpv/6428308680a2820b32ca9af5ca523d295e68c5119095c3d9f4a769458f8227e4</url>\n            <url size=\"thumb\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2kfj3pca7q3pq37fg9chdkz00vpv/7c367cff06fd518c1ca8f9254efb0ec25a25cd43a892ea5364918efafd429189</url>\n            <alt/>\n          </image>\n        </images>\n        <properties>\n          <property>\n            <name>Trailer</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sdFUpPAApJQ</value>\n          </property>\n          <property>\n            <name>Restoration</name>\n            <value>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wNfBjhWwnlY</value>\n          </property>\n        </properties>\n        <events>\n          <event id=\"428890967\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[31 Oct 2026 - 18:00 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 17:15) DRACULA]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-10-31T18:00:00+00:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-10-31T17:15:00+00:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428890967</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173692836/events/428890967/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173692836/events/428890967.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173692837\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[DRACULA: PRINCE OF DARKNESS]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>Dracula: Prince of Darkness&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/pn0o5t6fvpp9zc11sn3yihlfsu4w/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre: Horror</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK | 1966 | 90 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director: Terence Fisher</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;Christopher Lee, Barbara Shelley, Andrew Keir</font></div><div>\n<p><font size=\"3\">Transylvania, 10 years\nafter the events of <b><i>Dracula</i></b>. When four adventurous English holidaymakers fail to\nheed warnings to keep well away from Dracula&rsquo;s castle, they risk terrifying\nconsequences. This macabre sequel creates an intriguing sense of mystery, and\nfeatures the gun-toting Father Sandor (Andrew Keir) as Dracula&rsquo;s primary\nadversary. </font></p>\n\n<p><font size=\"3\"><b><i>60th anniversary\npresentation, in association with&nbsp;</i></b><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">The Cinema Museum</a><b><i>, of an original Technicolor\n35mm &lsquo;scope print.</i></b></font></p>\n<p><b><font size=\"3\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\"><i>SPECIAL OFFER:</i>Save &pound;2 by booking both Halloween Dracula\nfilms at the same time. Ensure that both have been added to your basket before\nchecking out.</font></b></p>\n</div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category>35mm Film</event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://www.davidleancinema.uk/#whatson</url>\n        <version>58</version>\n        <tags>\n          <tag>hw</tag>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/obteu0gov1bpuqn44ekfoynb6h6p/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204ef