ime 13:45) TENZING]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-03T14:30:00+00:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-03T13:45:00+00:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428897754</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693763/events/428897754/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693763/events/428897754.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n          <event id=\"428897755\">\n            <name>\n              <![CDATA[03 Nov 2026 - 19:30 @ David Lean Cinema - (opening time 18:45) TENZING]]>\n            </name>\n            <date_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-03T19:30:00+00:00</date_time_iso>\n            <opening_time_iso format=\"ISO 8601\" zone=\"GMT\">2026-11-03T18:45:00+00:00</opening_time_iso>\n            <event_number>428897755</event_number>\n            <venue_layout>David Lean Cinema</venue_layout>\n            <comment>\n              <![CDATA[]]>\n            </comment>\n            <event_attribute></event_attribute>\n            <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693763/events/428897755/seats</url>\n            <status>available</status>\n            <feed>\n              <url>https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/shows/1173693763/events/428897755.xml</url>\n            </feed>\n          </event>\n        </events>\n        <status>available</status>\n      </show>\n      <show id=\"1173692833\">\n        <name>\n          <![CDATA[THE CYCLE OF LOVE]]>\n        </name>\n        <description>\n          <![CDATA[<div>\n<font size=\"5\"><b>The Cycle of Love&nbsp;</b></font><img src=\"https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/as-assets/variants/2icwsyyao9k7fqtrodl3ovnt8y5u/a6206d8b8848d1f5f779dd436f25589e3a792fee204effd13dccee565e881abd\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;\">\n</div><div><font size=\"3\">Genre(s): Documentary/Biography/Action/Adventure/Sci-Fi</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">UK/India/Sweden/USA| 2025 | 98 mins</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Director:&nbsp;Orlando von Einsiede</font></div><div><font size=\"3\">Stars:&nbsp;PK Mahanandia, Anne-Charlotte von Schedvin, Mina\nDale</font></div><div>\n<p><font size=\"3\">In 1975, 23-year-old PK Mahanandia\nmakes a living drawing portraits for tourists in Delhi when he meets Lotta\n(Anne-Charlotte von Schedvin), a Swedish student visiting India. Convinced\ntheir meeting is destiny, PK recalls a childhood prophecy that he would marry a\nmusical woman from a far-off country, born under the sign of the ox. After\nspending time together, Lotta returns to Sweden, promising to come back once\nher studies are complete. But when she doesn&rsquo;t return as planned and PK cannot\nafford a plane ticket, he sells everything he owns, buys a second-hand bicycle\nand sets off on a 6,000-mile journey across continents to find her.</font></p>\n\n\n\n<p><font size=\"3\">Based on an extraordinary true\nstory, <b><i>The Cycle of Love</i></b> is a heart-warming tale of love, destiny\nand the courage to risk everything for the person you love. Blending\ndocumentary interviews with dramatised scenes, it&rsquo;s an epic journey that we\nchallenge you not to shed a tear for!</font></p>\n</div>]]>\n        </description>\n        <event_category></event_category>\n        <production_company_name></production_company_name>\n        <priority>0</priority>\n        <url>https://www.davidleancinema.uk/#whatson</url>\n        <version>57</version>\n        <tags>\n        </tags>\n        <images>\n          <image priority=\"90\">\n            <url size=\"large\">https://d1bry8u3byci8.cloudfront.net/a