has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Wednesday 21 October</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">at</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">2:30pm</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4a5f3f6b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group director-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e93bdf3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Directed by: Morgan Matthews</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group stars-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-04822461 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"inline-para wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Stars: Loré Adewusi, Dexter Sol Ansell, Eoin Duffy, Clare Dunne, Bill Nighy</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:15px\" class=\"entry-content alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-post-content-is-layout-e5d1e14d wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this emotional and involving drama, Finn and his brother Charlie run away from their Yorkshire home to escape the turmoil of their fractured family life and avoid being separated from each other by their divorcing parents. Carried along by their own quick wits and the kindness of strangers, they head to the wild west coast of Ireland, the home of their beloved but estranged grandfather. This life affirming road movie is cleverly interwoven with flashbacks of joyful memories and features outstanding performances from a multi generational cast.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"ticket-buttons\"><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173691031/events/428901851/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group trailer-block has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><div class=\"youtube-responsive-wrapper\">\n        <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M0pP7xKvFJ0\"\n            title=\"YouTube video player\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n\t\t\treferrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n            allowfullscreen><br />\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-3513d07\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"3513d07\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-3513d07 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 33.3% !important;}}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-3513d07 {padding-top:30px !important;}}</style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-3