rg/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><path d=\"M0 24C0 10.7 10.7 0 24 0H69.5c22 0 41.5 12.8 50.6 32h411c26.3 0 45.5 25 38.6 50.4l-41 152.3c-8.5 31.4-37 53.3-69.5 53.3H170.7l5.4 28.5c2.2 11.3 12.1 19.5 23.6 19.5H488c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H199.7c-34.6 0-64.3-24.6-70.7-58.5L77.4 54.5c-.7-3.8-4-6.5-7.9-6.5H24C10.7 48 0 37.3 0 24zM128 464a48 48 0 1 1 96 0 48 48 0 1 1 -96 0zm336-48a48 48 0 1 1 0 96 48 48 0 1 1 0-96z\"/></svg></div></span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header></div>\n\n\n\n<main id=\"wp--skip-link--target\" class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-light-gold-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:50px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-columns stk-block-columns stk-block stk-60bfbb8\" data-block-id=\"60bfbb8\"><style>.stk-60bfbb8-column{--stk-columns-spacing:0px !important;--stk-column-gap:20px !important;}</style><div class=\"stk-row stk-inner-blocks stk-block-content stk-content-align stk-60bfbb8-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-a6fa1f5\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"a6fa1f5\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-a6fa1f5 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 66.7% !important;}}</style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-a6fa1f5-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-a6fa1f5-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-title is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-84d39786 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><h1 style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-xx-large-font-size\">1 in 2</h1>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/wp-content/themes/davidleancinema/img/15-icon.svg\" alt=\"15 certificate\" class=\"age-rating-icon\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-meta has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\">2026</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">UK</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">142 mins</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-date has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Tuesday 17 November</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">at</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">2:30pm</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4a5f3f6b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group director-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e93bdf3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Directed by: David Wilkinson</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group stars-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-04822461 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"inline-para wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Stars: James Van Der Beek, Miriam Margolyes, Chadwick Boseman</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:15px\" class=\"entry-content alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-post-content-is-layout-e5d1e14d wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Nearly one in two people in the UK will be diagnosed with cancer at some point in our lives. In this thought-provoking documentary, the director uses his own cancer treatment and the experiences of others to question why the health service still finds it difficult to identify cancer until it has reached an advanced stage. Although this is a grim subject, Wilkinson treats it with humour and tries to offer hope for the future.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The film is part of part of&nbsp;Maggie’s 30th Anniversary Celebrations.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Tickets go on sale at 9pm on 8th October</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"ticket-buttons\"><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173693770/events/428897766/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW 2:30pm</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group trailer-block has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><div class=\"youtube-responsive-wrapper\">\n        <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sy0Jkwf3e-4\"\n            title=\"YouTube video player\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n\t\t\treferrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n            allowfullscreen><br />\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-3513d07\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"3513d07\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-3513d07 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 33.3% !important;}}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-3513d07 {padding-top:30px !important;}}</style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-3513d07-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-3513d07-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-roboto-condensed-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">BACK TO: <a href=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"7\">WHAT&#8217;S ON</a></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-poster-image has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:15px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-027db97\" data-block-id=\"027db97\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch stk--has-lightbox\"><img class=\"stk-img\" src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.o