 data-block-id=\"a6fa1f5\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-a6fa1f5 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 66.7% !important;}}</style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-a6fa1f5-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-a6fa1f5-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-title is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-84d39786 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><h1 style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-xx-large-font-size\">Dracula: Prince of Darkness</h1>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/wp-content/themes/davidleancinema/img/15-icon.svg\" alt=\"15 certificate\" class=\"age-rating-icon\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-meta has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\">1966</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">UK</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">90 mins</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-date has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Saturday 31 October</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">at</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">8:30pm</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4a5f3f6b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\"><div style=\"line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px\" class=\"taxonomy-event-category wp-block-post-terms\">35mm</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group director-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e93bdf3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Directed by: Terence Fisher</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group stars-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-04822461 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"inline-para wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Stars: Christopher Lee, Barbara Shelley, Andrew Keir</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:15px\" class=\"entry-content alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-post-content-is-layout-e5d1e14d wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Transylvania, 10 years after the events of <strong><em>Dracula</em></strong>. The Count is dead but when four English tourists exploring the Carpathians fail to heed warnings to keep well away from his castle, they risk terrifying consequences. With Terence Fisher’s masterful direction, this macabre sequel creates an intriguing sense of mystery, and features the gun-toting Father Sandor (Andrew Keir) as Dracula’s primary adversary. Halloween screening, with support from Croydon Council.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>60th anniversary presentation, in association with&nbsp;</em></strong><a href=\"http://www.cinemamuseum.org.uk/\">The Cinema Museum</a><strong><em>, of an original Technicolor 35mm ‘scope print.</em></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>SPECIAL OFFER:</em> Save £2 by booking both Halloween Dracula films at the same time. Ensure that both have been added to your basket before checking out.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"ticket-buttons\"><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173692837/events/428890968/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW 8:30pm</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group trailer-block has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><div class=\"youtube-responsive-wrapper\">\n        <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dn2QmJRgnR4\"\n            title=\"YouTube video player\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n\t\t\treferrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n            allowfullscreen><br />\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</