__content stk-container stk-a6fa1f5-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-a6fa1f5-inner-blocks\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-title is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-84d39786 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><h1 style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-xx-large-font-size\">The Dog Stars</h1>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/wp-content/themes/davidleancinema/img/15-icon.svg\" alt=\"15 certificate\" class=\"age-rating-icon\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-meta has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\">2026</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">USA/UK</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">118 mins</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-date has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Thursday 29 October</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">at</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">2:30pm* &amp; 7:30pm</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4a5f3f6b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\"><div style=\"line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px\" class=\"taxonomy-event-category wp-block-post-terms\">*Captioned</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group director-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e93bdf3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Directed by: Ridley Scott</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group stars-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-04822461 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"inline-para wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Stars: Jacob Elordi, Josh Brolin, Margaret Qualley</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:15px\" class=\"entry-content alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-post-content-is-layout-e5d1e14d wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a world ravaged by a virus that has wiped out most of humanity, Jacob Elordi plays Hig, a pilot who lost everyone he loved. Living in a small community, he and the other survivors stay ever wary of the ruthless scavengers who terrorise the few left alive. When a radio transmission crackles through the silence, it stirs a fragile hope that a better life might exist and Hig risks everything on a chance at salvation. Margaret Qualley and Josh Brolin co-star in Ridley Scott&#8217;s post-apocalyptic vision of the end of the world.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>Our 2:30pm screening includes captioned subtitles for those with hearing loss.</em></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><em>This film contains flashing images which may affect viewers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy.</em></strong></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"ticket-buttons\"><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173692834/events/428890964/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW 2:30pm*</a><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173692834/events/428890965/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW 7:30pm</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group trailer-block has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><div class=\"youtube-responsive-wrapper\">\n        <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-xSxaE1ClEE\"\n            title=\"YouTube video player\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n\t\t\treferrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n            allowfullscreen><br />\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-3513d07\" data-v=