al;font-weight:600\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-xx-large-font-size\">Bad Apples</h1>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/wp-content/themes/davidleancinema/img/15-icon.svg\" alt=\"15 certificate\" class=\"age-rating-icon\"></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-meta has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\">2025</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">USA/UK</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5 wp-block-paragraph\">|</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6 wp-block-paragraph\">100 mins</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-date has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-7 is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-36730ca6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.929rem, 0.929rem + ((1vw - 0.2rem) * 0.856), 1.4rem);font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:none\">\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8 wp-block-paragraph\">Saturday 24 October</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">at</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-navy-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-paragraph\">2:00pm</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4a5f3f6b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group director-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3e93bdf3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Directed by: Jonathan Etzler</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group stars-block is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-04822461 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"inline-para wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600\">Stars: Jacob Anderson, Saoirse Ronan, Robert Emms</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"padding-right:0px;padding-left:0px;margin-top:15px\" class=\"entry-content alignfull wp-block-post-content has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-post-content-is-layout-e5d1e14d wp-block-post-content-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A blackly comic British thriller, adapted from the Swedish novel <em>De Oönskare</em> (The Unwanted), and starring Saoirse Ronan as struggling primary school teacher Maria. After a behavioural incident on a school trip, she makes an escalating series of bad choices. Surprised however by the knock-on effects of these decisions, the audience is ultimately left to decide the fallout from Maria&#8217;s extreme approach to classroom management. Featuring some incredibly realistic classroom scenes and fantastic performances from Oscar nominee Ronan and her students played by Eddie Waller and Nia Brown, this 2025 festival favourite is a must watch this term. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Our Tuesday 7:30pm screening contains descriptive subtitles for those with hearing loss.</strong></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\"><div class=\"ticket-buttons\"><a href=\"https://davidleancinema.ticketsolve.com/ticketbooth/shows/1173692748/events/428890953/seats?zone=David%20Lean%20Cinema\" class=\"ticket-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BOOK NOW 2:00pm</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group trailer-block has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><div class=\"youtube-responsive-wrapper\">\n        <iframe\n            src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gZn1kdqGi1w\"\n            title=\"YouTube video player\"\n            frameborder=\"0\"\n\t\t\treferrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"\n            allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n            allowfullscreen><br />\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-column stk-block-column stk-column stk-block stk-3513d07\" data-v=\"4\" data-block-id=\"3513d07\"><style>@media screen and (min-width: 768px){.stk-3513d07 {flex:var(--stk-flex-grow, 1) 1 33.3% !important;}}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px){.stk-3513d07 {padding-top:30px !important;}}</style><div class=\"stk-column-wrapper stk-block-column__content stk-container stk-3513d07-container stk--no-background stk--no-padding\"><div class=\"stk-block-content stk-inner-blocks stk-3513d07-inner-blocks\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-roboto-condensed-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">BACK TO: <a href=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"7\">WHAT&#8217;S ON</a></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group event-poster-image has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:15px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-027db97\" data-block-id=\"027db97\"><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch stk--has-lightbox\"><img class=\"stk-img\" src=\"https://www.davidleancinema.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bad-apples-709x1024.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Film poster\"/></span></figure></div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</main>\n\n\n<footer class=\"wp-block-template-part\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-mid-gold-background-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-navy-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-154a3b34 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;padding-top:30px;padding-bottom:30px\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mail-strap has-gold-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-11\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px\"><strong>SEE THE WORLD.</strong> <br>ONE FILM AT A TIME.</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-12 wp-block-paragraph\">Get our weekly updates by email</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-content-justification-space-between is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e3289ce6 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\"><p><script>(function() {\n\twindow.mc4wp = window.mc4wp || {\n\t\tlisteners: [],\n\t\tforms: {\n\t\t\ton: function(evt, cb) {\n\t\t\t\twindow.mc4wp.listeners.push(\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tevent   : evt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\tcallback: cb\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t}\n})();\n</script><!-- Mailchimp for WordPress v4.14.1 - https://wordpress.org/plugins/mailchimp-for-wp/ --></p>\n<form id=\"mc4wp-form-1\" class=\"mc4wp-form mc4wp-form-268525\" method=\"post\" data-id=\"268525\" data-name=\"Website signup